WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.593 --> 00:00:15.295
campers were in the assembly hall for evening program.

2
00:00:16.036 --> 00:00:18.938
They sat in a circle while Penelope led them in a song.

3
00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:22.461
"I love the mountains.

4
00:00:22.982 --> 00:00:26.084
I love the rolling hills," everyone sang.

5
00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:30.548
Ivy poked Glen and pointed at the Ucks across the circle.

6
00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:32.813
Glen nodded.

7
00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:38.416
"Boom-dee-a-da, boom-dee-ay," Penelope and the others sang.

8
00:00:39.876 --> 00:00:42.318
Glen crouched down and crept over to the Ucks.

9
00:00:44.139 --> 00:00:46.360
"I still have some candy," he whispered.

10
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.982
"Come to the square after evening program if you want some."

11
00:00:52.203 --> 00:00:53.104
The Ucks nodded.

12
00:00:54.785 --> 00:00:57.766
Glen scooted back to his spot and smiled at Ivy.

13
00:00:59.527 --> 00:01:03.201
When the song ended, Wes Wheezer stood up and blew his bugle.

14
00:01:03.221 --> 00:01:07.243
"Good night, campers, and sweet dreams!"

15
00:01:07.603 --> 00:01:08.403
Penelope said.

16
00:01:08.423 --> 00:01:12.345
"Be ready for more Evergreen fun tomorrow!"

17
00:01:16.747 --> 00:01:20.408
Ivy, Glen, and Ezra rushed out the door and went straight to the square.

18
00:01:20.428 --> 00:01:25.390
"I hope this works," Ezra said.

19
00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:29.312
"It will if the Ucks show up for their candy," Ivy said.

20
00:01:30.592 --> 00:01:33.975
The three kids dropped to the grass and stretched out on their stomachs.

21
00:01:35.356 --> 00:01:38.819
Soon they heard voices and saw flashlights shining.

22
00:01:38.839 --> 00:01:41.702
"They're coming!"

23
00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:42.883
Ivy whispered.

24
00:01:42.903 --> 00:01:44.284
"Stay down."

25
00:01:46.365 --> 00:01:48.447
In the dark the Ucks couldn't see them.

26
00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:53.652
"Where's Snuggy Wuggy's stupid friend with our candy?"

27
00:01:54.032 --> 00:01:54.713
Chuck asked.

28
00:01:54.733 --> 00:01:57.575
"He'll have it, if he knows what's good for him!"

29
00:01:57.935 --> 00:01:58.496
Huck said.

30
00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:02.742
Across the square, Ivy saw something move.

31
00:02:02.762 --> 00:02:06.224
"Look, Mango and Larry are coming!"

32
00:02:07.866 --> 00:02:09.427
Three dark shadows approached.

33
00:02:10.747 --> 00:02:14.750
Mango was pushing the bear statue on a flatbed cart across the grass.

34
00:02:15.571 --> 00:02:19.253
Larry walked next to the cart, trying to keep the bear from falling off.

35
00:02:22.215 --> 00:02:23.216
The Ucks froze.

36
00:02:23.236 --> 00:02:25.438
"Wh-what's that?"

37
00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:26.358
Buck asked.

38
00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:31.650
"Whoa!" Larry said as the statue bounced on the cart.

39
00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.612
"Hey, like, be careful, Mango!

40
00:02:35.193 --> 00:02:36.254
This thing could break.

41
00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:40.477
And it would be, like, really bad if we broke Mr.

42
00:02:40.657 --> 00:02:42.239
Offal's special gift!"

43
00:02:44.861 --> 00:02:48.444
The Ucks shined their flashlights on the statue as it bounced and wobbled.

44
00:02:50.045 --> 00:02:50.746
Ivy grinned.

45
00:02:51.466 --> 00:02:54.128
Her plan was working even better than she'd imagined.

46
00:02:55.269 --> 00:02:58.372
The statue looked like a real bear moving through the darkness!

47
00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:01.369
"Ahh! It's a bear!"

48
00:03:01.809 --> 00:03:02.489
Chuck shouted.

49
00:03:02.509 --> 00:03:04.110
"A bear!

50
00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.371
Help!" Buck screamed.

51
00:03:07.111 --> 00:03:08.312
The Ucks started running.

52
00:03:08.332 --> 00:03:11.013
"Who's there?"

53
00:03:11.413 --> 00:03:12.914
Larry sounded confused.

54
00:03:14.315 --> 00:03:18.196
From their hiding spot, Ivy and the boys covered their mouths and laughed.

55
00:03:19.377 --> 00:03:21.318
"The Ucks are so scared!"

56
00:03:21.818 --> 00:03:22.518
Ivy whispered.

57
00:03:23.859 --> 00:03:25.560
Suddenly they saw a bright light.

58
00:03:27.468 --> 00:03:30.489
Private ran toward the square carrying a big lantern.

59
00:03:30.509 --> 00:03:33.010
"What's all this noise?"

60
00:03:34.111 --> 00:03:36.052
Behind her, more people appeared.

61
00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:38.152
Some were wearing pajamas.

62
00:03:38.172 --> 00:03:41.254
"Mommy, save me!"

63
00:03:42.594 --> 00:03:45.195
Buck ran to Private, almost knocking her over.

64
00:03:45.215 --> 00:03:47.616
"Calm down!"

65
00:03:48.116 --> 00:03:48.937
Private shouted.

66
00:03:48.957 --> 00:03:51.198
"I am not your mommy!"

67
00:03:53.439 --> 00:03:56.360
The campers laughed at Buck, who was shaking all over.

68
00:03:58.016 --> 00:03:59.097
"Let's join the others.

69
00:03:59.878 --> 00:04:02.260
They'll think we just got here," Ivy whispered.

70
00:04:03.601 --> 00:04:05.462
She and the boys slipped into the crowd.

71
00:04:05.482 --> 00:04:08.465
"What's wrong?

72
00:04:08.665 --> 00:04:10.587
Was someone screaming about a bear in camp?"

73
00:04:10.967 --> 00:04:11.768
Penelope said.

74
00:04:11.788 --> 00:04:14.830
"Of course there's a bear.

75
00:04:15.431 --> 00:04:18.353
A bear statue," Private said.

76
00:04:19.614 --> 00:04:24.018
The crowd watched as Mango moved the statue while Larry held the cart still.

77
00:04:24.838 --> 00:04:28.694
It wobbled as Mango set it down, then finally it stood still.

78
00:04:30.035 --> 00:04:30.875
Mango sighed.

79
00:04:30.895 --> 00:04:35.119
"Whew!" Larry patted Mango's shoulder.

80
00:04:35.139 --> 00:04:38.602
"That was, like, great teamwork."

81
00:04:40.564 --> 00:04:41.805
"A statue?"

82
00:04:42.665 --> 00:04:44.187
Buck was still shaking his head.

83
00:04:44.207 --> 00:04:46.729
"It looked so real!"

84
00:04:46.749 --> 00:04:50.452
"Hey, Buck," Ezra said.

85
00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.301
"Did you call Private your mommy?"

86
00:04:54.802 --> 00:04:55.703
Everyone laughed.

87
00:04:57.284 --> 00:04:59.505
Buck glared at Ezra but kept quiet.

88
00:05:01.106 --> 00:05:02.346
Private blew her whistle.

89
00:05:02.366 --> 00:05:05.548
"Time for bed, campers!"

90
00:05:06.849 --> 00:05:08.390
The crowd walked toward the cabins.

91
00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:11.652
"We did it!"

92
00:05:12.172 --> 00:05:13.333
Ivy whispered gleefully.

93
00:05:13.353 --> 00:05:15.614
"We scared those Ucks!"

94
00:05:16.795 --> 00:05:18.716
Glen grinned and so did Ezra.

95
00:05:19.721 --> 00:05:21.090
"Great teamwork!"

96
00:05:21.473 --> 00:05:22.076
he said with a
